{"overview":"کینوشیتا کازویا دانشجوی ۲۰ ساله‌ای است که در زندگی‌اش شکست خورده. یک بار توانست دوست دخترش را بوسه بزند اما پس از یک ماه رها شد. کازویا با کینه‌توزی روش خاصی برای قرار ملاقات با دختران دارد. به محل ملاقات می‌رود و دختری زیبا که موهای بلند سیاهش را پشت گوش می‌کشید، با لبخندی به او نگاه می‌کند؛ نام او میزوهره چیزورو است. پس از یک بار اجاره، چیزی واقعی شکل می‌گیرد! یک رمانس کمدی پرشور و هیجان به‌زودی آغاز می‌شود!","tagline":"","overview_en":"Kinoshita Kazuya is a 20-year-old failure of a college student. He managed to kiss his girlfriend once, but was dumped after a month. Completely spiteful, Kazuya uses a certain method to date a girl. He goes to their meeting place and a beautiful girl brushing her long, black hair behind her ear was there, smiling at him. Her name was Mizuhara Chizuru. Something real is born after just a single rental! A reckless rom-com filled with love and excitement is about to begin!","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":138,"y":2020,"poster":"/dstztSaugA48W0aYMh1qCvXAaRY.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":60,"y":2020,"poster":"/vfdgVIMxH77wvr0dWhwJM2OgmfX.jpg"}],"episodes":60,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"堀江瞬","role":"Kazuya Kinoshita (voice)","photo":"/1OFi5ofRX0B2ldTPF8ThzLI2wKa.jpg","en":"Shun Horie"},{"name":"雨宮天","role":"Chizuru Mizuhara (voice)","photo":"/AouA1SfwEazdSSj8rUS9K1WIF4H.jpg","en":"Sora Amamiya"},{"name":"悠木碧","role":"Mami Nanami (voice)","photo":"/a5Mkd66GV1l3c9bZZtnvjUf33T2.jpg","en":"Aoi Yuki"},{"name":"نائو تیاما","role":"Ruka Sarashina (voice)","photo":"/6WJDd1z946yFfZBgpC7dWi0FyQw.jpg","en":"Nao Toyama"},{"name":"高橋李依","role":"Sumi Sakurasawa (voice)","photo":"/aeB7z0cBTASdjKOjQriBAO6hYq4.jpg","en":"Rie Takahashi"},{"name":"芹澤優","role":"Mini Yaemori (voice)","photo":"/mQITB0XYHCZjYef39xsHnSHIH56.jpg","en":"Yu Serizawa"},{"name":"野沢由香里","role":"Nagomi Kinoshita (voice)","photo":"/fItDKJF3RDg2EgOQcgW6z9mXeoY.jpg","en":"Yuka